{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_cbfe3869314a491a8ba9d5b0e6b29aba","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8903dc642be7c1c55d384f35fbb379ec12ab08b4c5a489043a6c6d57eac34944","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"patrickdappollonio/dux@14e044d616d2 snapshot 9cf959f4d95c8dad","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a40038cd1b9a816bb75ec70501e16db3654947987c8d594e2d0548843947d623","slc_a43562651e1a80d4b36185f198c5e927415261b6d276ce24957701ba6fd29e0c"],"source_ids":["src_1a20a257cf9e59208174d271dbe9b397"],"text":"Palette commands include change-agent-provider, change-default-provider, and change-project-default-provider for switching providers per worktree, globally, or per project, with resume_args reused when available.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_cbfe3869314a491a8ba9d5b0e6b29aba"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_cbfe3869314a491a8ba9d5b0e6b29aba","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a22d9d059994befb9bce672d8aab79cd9c3d58b8102df4511c9842432f8d5b94","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"patrickdappollonio/dux@14e044d616d2 snapshot 9cf959f4d95c8dad","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_11cd674cf70b6999270636769b77a4f42d43d9f1bb92c52a0b2cfe1ed5e7c099","slc_36cd83e9720797be18ceb6d7f5002c90ab70289721e78f25ad74b31b599ef361"],"source_ids":["src_1a20a257cf9e59208174d271dbe9b397"],"text":"Any terminal command can be a provider via a TOML config entry with command, args, and optional resume_args; built-in defaults include Claude, Codex, and OpenCode, and adding a provider is config-only.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_cbfe3869314a491a8ba9d5b0e6b29aba"}
