{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_cbfe3869314a491a8ba9d5b0e6b29aba","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_df90e48dec2785e69ad94e41d095d61cdc775973453854792fae20c2fd5d66ec","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"patrickdappollonio/dux@14e044d616d2 snapshot 9cf959f4d95c8dad","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5cb9a6c04b4c1cd5ec357d5aba6165f3339c7df20886c324e9430407db0e9746"],"source_ids":["src_1a20a257cf9e59208174d271dbe9b397"],"text":"dux is a terminal UI that runs multiple AI coding agents side by side, each in its own git worktree, with companion terminals, macros, commit generation, and a command palette.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_cbfe3869314a491a8ba9d5b0e6b29aba"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_cbfe3869314a491a8ba9d5b0e6b29aba","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f90c6ce639f60c5dd3541de2e4ee89d90a6a0a0ee12c1c17ab004db824b8c024","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"patrickdappollonio/dux@14e044d616d2 snapshot 9cf959f4d95c8dad","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_de71c88a76fa000d5c5cc9a4904bae28fb88e01709185affa7fd56bf4207d176"],"source_ids":["src_1a20a257cf9e59208174d271dbe9b397"],"text":"Agents run through a PTY like a normal shell, so CLIs such as Claude, Codex, or OpenCode behave as they would in a regular terminal, including MCP servers, hooks, and permission dialogs.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_cbfe3869314a491a8ba9d5b0e6b29aba"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_cbfe3869314a491a8ba9d5b0e6b29aba","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_fa614dff30db6eb0c77c1e534ebd5c1ff3e47f09dfcf21dccfbcbe2f8f1fd41e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"patrickdappollonio/dux@14e044d616d2 snapshot 9cf959f4d95c8dad","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_54c21ecea33220762b375e9b6aefed1bbccb99f7cffcc9d36f98f23720821c88","slc_cb7c16d0ac30624268424c256fe80592d95a48d7697d38c1d49f5c36214e98ed"],"source_ids":["src_1a20a257cf9e59208174d271dbe9b397"],"text":"git is required on PATH; the gh CLI is optional and enables PR status tracking shown as status pills in the interface.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_cbfe3869314a491a8ba9d5b0e6b29aba"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_cbfe3869314a491a8ba9d5b0e6b29aba","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ff104f5610089b2d526b76c26b365dd298cdceffa6c8e9027d34ce441cfb190d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"patrickdappollonio/dux@14e044d616d2 snapshot 9cf959f4d95c8dad","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b590638af391e0fccd136235e2e6af6926679d423dcb536cfb68584af9448a8d"],"source_ids":["src_1a20a257cf9e59208174d271dbe9b397"],"text":"The interface has three panes: projects and agent sessions on the left, the agent's live terminal output or diff in the center, and changed files, staging, and diffs on the right.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:30:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_cbfe3869314a491a8ba9d5b0e6b29aba"}
